:: Eden Halloween
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<wearProp "halloween">>
<<speechresolve>>
주황색 단풍잎이 숲의 나무들을 물들이고, 땅을 뒤덮어 발을 디딜 때마다 바삭거린다. 과자 바구니를 들고 에덴에게 다가가자, <<He>>【이가】 하던 일에서 잠시 고개를 들어 당신을 보다가, 손에 든 것을 알아차리고 멈춘다.
<br><br>

<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"H-Happy Halloween," you say, holding the hamper out to <<him>> with both hands.
	<<case "polite">>
		"Happy Halloween," you say warmly, offering the hamper to <<him>>.
	<<case "docile">>
		"Happy Halloween," you say, carefully presenting the hamper to <<him>>.
	<<case "flamboyant">>
		"Happy Halloween, darling," you say, offering the hamper with a bright smile.
	<<case "bratty">>
		"Happy Halloween," you say, nudging the hamper into <<his>> hands.
	<<case "cruel">>
		"Happy Halloween," you say, pressing the hamper at <<him>> like a challenge.
	<<case "confident">>
		"Happy Halloween," you say, handing the hamper over like you knew <<he>> would take it.
	<<case "special">>
		"Happy Halloween," you say, offering the hamper with a look that dares <<him>> to refuse it.
	<<default>>
		"해피 할로윈." 당신은 <<him>>에게 바구니를 건네며 말한다.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

"과자?" <<he>>【이가】 당신의 선물을 훑어보며 묻는다. "이거 뜻밖인데."
<br><br>

<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"그-그게, 사탕을 안 받으셨으니까, 제가 과자를 가져다 드리면 어떨까 해서요." 당신이 말한다.
	<<case "polite">>
		"Since you don't go trick-or-treating, I thought you might appreciate some sweets anyway," you say.
	<<case "docile">>
		"You don't go trick-or-treating, so I thought I should bring something to you instead," you say.
	<<case "flamboyant">>
		"Since you won't go trick-or-treating, I thought I'd bring the sweets to you instead," you say lightly.
	<<case "bratty">>
		"할로윈 이벤트를 안 한다고 과자를 안 먹을 이유는 없잖아요." 당신이 말한다.
	<<case "cruel">>
		"If you insist on staying out here instead of trick-or-treating, you can at least have sweets," you say.
	<<case "confident">>
		"You don't go trick-or-treating, so I figured I'd bring Halloween to you," you say.
	<<case "special">>
		"You weren't going to go out for sweets yourself, so I brought them to you," you say.
	<<default>>
		"할로윈 이벤트를 안 하시니까 좋아하실 것 같아서요." 당신이 말한다.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

에덴은 바구니를 다시 한번 쳐다본다. <<his>> 눈에는 확신이 없으면서도 고마워하는 기색이 서려 있다. "고마워." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "좋네, 어차피 단 걸 많이 먹는 편은 아니지만."
As <<he>> starts toward the kitchen to store the hamper away, your eyes catch on the dining table instead. A knife rests beside a few pumpkins, their vivid orange skin standing out against the muted wood and the autumn light filtering through the cabin.
<br><br>

에덴은 당신의 시선을 알아차리고 멈춰 서서 바구니를 내려놓는다. "호박 파이를 만들 계획이었어." <<he>>【이가】 식탁에 펼쳐진 것들을 보며 말한다.
<br><br>

<<link [[호박을 조각하자고 한다|Eden Carve]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[고개를 끄덕인다|Eden Nod]]>><</link>>

:: Eden Nod
<<effects>>

당신은 대답으로 고개를 끄덕인다. 에덴이 과자를 치우기 위해 근처 수납장을 열다가, 갑자기 마음을 바꾸고 당신을 쳐다본다.
<br><br>

"이거 나랑 같이 먹지 않을래?" <<he>>【이가】 묻는다.
<br><br>

<<link [[수락한다|Eden Sweets]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[거절한다|Eden Sweets Refuse]]>><</link>>

:: Eden Sweets Refuse
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

당신은 고개를 젓는다.

<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"이-이 과자는 당신을 위해 산 거예요."
	<<case "polite">>
		"They're for you. I bought them with you in mind."
	<<case "docile">>
		"I bought them for you... You should keep them."
	<<case "flamboyant">>
		"No, no, they're yours. I brought them for you."
	<<case "bratty">>
		"널 주려고 산 과자야. 네 거야."
	<<case "cruel">>
		"I brought them for you, so stop trying to hand them back."
	<<case "confident">>
		"I brought them for you, not for me."
	<<case "special">>
		"They're yours. I didn't come all this way just to keep them for myself."
	<<default>>
		"널 위해 산 과자야."
<</switch>>
<br><br>

Eden shrugs and stores the hamper in the cabinet. <<He>> goes over to you and kisses your forehead. "Thanks again," <<he>> says, before walking away.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Eden Cabin]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Eden Carve
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

"호박 조각해도 돼요?" 당신이 묻는다.
<br><br>

"뭐?" <<he>>【이가】 믿을 수 없다는 표정을 지으며 묻는다. "이건 파이 만들려고 둔 거지, 조각하려는 게 아니었어."
<br><br>

<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"제발요?" 당신이 말한다.
	<<case "polite">>
		"Please? It would make the cabin feel festive," you say.
	<<case "docile">>
		"Please. Just two?" you ask hopefully.
	<<case "flamboyant">>
		"Please? It's Halloween," you say, dragging the words out playfully.
	<<case "bratty">>
		"아, 왜 이래요, 할로윈이잖아요!" 당신이 말한다.
	<<case "cruel">>
		"You can spare two pumpkins for carving," you say. "You'll live."
	<<case "confident">>
		"It's Halloween. We should carve them," you say.
	<<case "special">>
		"It's Halloween. Don't tell me you're too serious for pumpkins," you say.
	<<default>>
		"하지만 할로윈이잖아요." 당신이 말한다.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

에덴은 한숨을 쉬고 고개를 돌려 잠시 생각하더니, 다시 당신을 쳐다본다. "알았어." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "하지만 두 개만 쓸 거야."
<br><br>

A smile spreads across your face before you can stop it, and you hurry over to the table.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Eden Carve 2]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>

:: Eden Carve 2
<<effects>><<wearProp "knife">>

칼을 집어 들고, 당신과 에덴은 식탁 양 끝에 앉는다. 당신은 무엇을 조각할지 정한다.
<br><br>

<<link [[무서운 것|Eden Carve 3]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[귀여운 것|Eden Carve 3]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[에덴|Eden Carve 3]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>

:: Eden Carve 3
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

칼을 사용해 호박 표면을 깎아낸다.

<<if currentSkillValue('tending') gte 150>>
	<<if $phase is 0>>
		시간이 좀 걸렸지만, 완성된 결과물은 꽤 무서워 보인다.
	<<elseif $phase is 1>>
		시간이 좀 걸렸지만, 완성된 결과물은 꽤 귀여워 보인다.
	<<elseif $phase is 2>>
		시간이 좀 걸렸지만, 완성된 결과물은 에덴과 비교적 비슷해 보인다.
	<</if>>
<<else>>

	<<if $phase is 0>>
		최선을 다했지만, 조각이 그다지 무서워 보이지 않는다.
	<<elseif $phase is 1>>
		최선을 다했지만, 조각이 그다지 귀여워 보이지 않는다.
	<<elseif $phase is 2>>
		최선을 다했지만, 조각이 에덴과 그다지 비슷해 보이지 않는다.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

Stepping back from your work, you walk over to Eden to look at <<his>> creation. <<He>> has carved the image of a deer into the pumpkin. It looks skilfully done, the sort of patient work that makes it obvious how practiced <<hes>> with <<his>> hands.
<br><br>

<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"호-호박이 귀엽네." 당신이 말한다.
	<<case "polite">>
		"Your pumpkin turned out really cute," you say.
	<<case "docile">>
		"It looks cute," you say softly, admiring the carving.
	<<case "flamboyant">>
		"Your pumpkin is adorable," you say with a grin.
	<<case "bratty">>
		"귀여운 호박이네." 당신이 말한다.
	<<case "cruel">>
		"For something you were so grumpy about, that turned out cute," you say.
	<<case "confident">>
		"That's a cute carving," you say. "You did well."
	<<case "special">>
		"Your pumpkin's cute," you say. "Almost annoyingly so."
	<<default>>
		"그 호박 귀엽네." 당신이 말한다.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

에덴이 고개를 돌려 당신을 마주 본다. "호박이 귀여운 거라면, 너도 호박이라고 불러야겠네." <<he>>【이가】 장난스럽게 당신의 엉덩이를 때리며 웃는다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Eden Carve 4]]>><</link>>

:: Eden Carve 4
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

잠시 후, 에덴은 <<his>> 칼을 내려놓고 당신에게 다가와 조각품을 살핀다.
<br><br>

<<if currentSkillValue('tending') gte 150>>
	<<if $phase is 0>>
		"와, 무섭게 생겼네." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. <<He>>【은는】 감명받은 표정이다.
	<<elseif $phase is 1>>
		"와, 귀엽네." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. <<He>>【은는】 감명받은 표정이다.
	<<elseif $phase is 2>>
		<<He>>【은는】 <<his>> 얼굴에 약간 놀란 표정이 떠오른 채, 눈앞의 광경을 믿을 수 없다는 듯 당신의 작품을 감상한다.
		"이거 나야?" <<he>>【이가】 당신에게 고개를 돌리며 묻는다.
		<br><br>

		<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
			<<case "meek" "shy">>
				당신은 고개를 끄덕인다.
			<<case "polite">>
				"Yes," you say with a small smile.
			<<case "docile">>
				"Yes," you murmur.
			<<case "flamboyant">>
				"Of course," you say brightly.
			<<case "bratty">>
				"응." 당신이 말한다.
			<<case "cruel">>
				"Obviously," you say.
			<<case "confident">>
				"Yes. It is," you say.
			<<case "special">>
				"Maybe," you say, then smile. "Yes."
			<<default>>
				"그래." 당신이 말한다.
		<</switch>>
		<br><br>

		"잘했네." <<he>>【이가】 살짝 고개를 끄덕이며 말한다.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<He>>【은는】 잠시 그것을 쳐다보며, 무엇을 표현하려 한 건지 파악하려 한다.
	<br>

	<<if $phase is 0>>
		"무서운 걸 만들려고 한 거야." 당신이 말한다.
	<<elseif $phase is 1>>
		"귀여운 걸 만들려고 한 거야." 당신이 말한다.
	<<elseif $phase is 2>>
		"널 만들려고 한 거야." 당신이 말한다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Eden shoots you a smirk, clearly trying not to laugh too hard. "It's a good effort," <<he>> says, patting you on the head.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Eden Carve 5]]>><</link>>

:: Eden Carve 5
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

After a short deliberation, the two of you decide to decorate the cabin with your work. Eden opens the wooden door, and a wash of cool autumn air brushes across your face and slips beneath your clothes.
<<He>> places the pumpkins near the entrance. Their carved faces lend the severe little cabin a soft festive touch it normally lacks.
<br><br>

작품 감상을 마친 뒤, 당신과 에덴은 다시 안으로 들어간다. 테이블로 시선을 돌리자, 과자 바구니가 눈에 들어온다.
<br><br>

<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"아-아직 과자 안 먹었네." 당신은 말한다.
	<<case "polite">>
		"You still haven't tried the sweets yet," you say.
	<<case "docile">>
		"You haven't had any yet," you point out softly.
	<<case "flamboyant">>
		"You still haven't tried the sweets," you say, eyeing the hamper.
	<<case "bratty">>
		"어이, 아직 과자 안 먹었잖아." 당신은 말한다.
	<<case "cruel">>
		"You still haven't touched the sweets I brought," you say.
	<<case "confident">>
		"You still haven't tried them," you say, nodding toward the hamper.
	<<case "special">>
		"You haven't even tasted them yet," you say.
	<<default>>
		"아직 과자 안 먹었네." 당신은 말한다.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

에덴은 테이블을 보며 무언가 골똘히 생각하는 듯하다. "나랑 같이 나눠 먹는 건 어때?" <<he>>【이가】 묻는다.
<br><br>

<<link [[받아들인다|Eden Sweets]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[거절한다|Eden Sweets Refuse]]>><</link>>

:: Eden Sweets
<<effects>>

에덴의 제안을 받아들이고 테이블로 걸어간다. 칼 하나를 집어 든 <<he>>【은는】 바구니의 포장 비닐을 잘라 열고, 안쪽에 숨겨져 있던 작은 상자에 손을 뻗는다.
<br><br>

Upon opening the box, you both find it filled with creamy chocolate. The rich scent rises at once, thick and sweet enough to make your mouth water.
<br><br>

에덴이 한 조각을 집어 <<his>> 입으로 가져간다.
<br><br>

<<link [[에덴에게서 빼앗는다|Eden Sweets 2]]>><<set $phase2 to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[에덴이 먹게 둔다|Eden Sweets 2]]>><</link>>

:: Eden Sweets 2
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if $phase2 is 1>>
	<<wearProp "chocolate">><<canvas-model-override "mouth" "chew">>
	초콜릿이 <<his>> 입으로 들어가기 직전, 에덴에게서 그것을 낚아채 꿀꺽 삼켜버린다.
	<br><br>

	"야!" 에덴이 당신을 돌아보며 소리친다.
	<br><br>
	<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
		<<case "meek" "shy">>
			"나-나눠 먹자고 했잖아." 당신이 놀린다.
		<<case "polite">>
			"You did say we were sharing," you remind <<him>>, teasingly.
		<<case "docile">>
			"You said we were sharing," you say with a small smile.
		<<case "flamboyant">>
			"You said we were sharing," you tease. "I'm only taking you seriously."
		<<case "bratty">>
			"뭐야? 나눠 먹자고 했잖아." 당신이 놀린다.
		<<case "cruel">>
			"You said we were sharing. Don't complain now," you tease.
		<<case "confident">>
			"You said we were sharing," you say, looking pleased with yourself.
		<<case "special">>
			"You offered to share," you tease. "I'm just participating."
		<<default>>
			"나눠 먹자고 했잖아." 당신이 놀린다.
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>

	에덴이 반박하려 입을 열었다가 멈춘다. <<His>> 눈이 반짝이고, 장난기 어린 미소가 <<his>> 얼굴에 번진다. "좋아. 나눠 먹자." <<he>>【이가】 초콜릿 하나에 손가락을 천천히, 애태우듯 문지르며 말한다.
	<br><br>

	<<He>> brings <<his>> chocolate-coated finger up to your mouth, looking at you with heated eyes. "Come on. I know you want to."
<<else>>
	당신은 에덴이 초콜릿 조각을 먹는 것을 지켜본다. <<He>>【은는】 그 단맛을 즐기는 것 같다.
	<br><br>

	"오랜만에 초콜릿 먹네." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. 당신을 돌아보며, <<he>>【은는】 상자를 건넨다. "하나 먹을래?"
	<br><br>

	대답하려는 순간, 에덴이 뭔가 떠오른 듯한 표정을 짓는다. <<His>> 눈이 반짝이고, 장난기 어린 미소가 <<his>> 얼굴에 번진다. "이걸 더 재미있게 만들 수 있을 것 같아." <<he>>【이가】 초콜릿 하나에 손가락을 천천히, 애태우듯 문지르며 말한다.
	<br><br>

	<<He>> brings <<his>> chocolate-coated finger up to your mouth, looking at you with heated eyes. "Come on. I know you want to."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[에덴의 손가락을 핥는다|Eden Sweets Lick]]>><<canvas-model-override "clear">><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[거절한다|Eden Sweets Lick Refuse]]>><<canvas-model-override "clear">><</link>>

:: Eden Sweets Lick Refuse
<<effects>>

당신은 얼굴을 돌린다. 에덴은 당신을 보고 킥킥 웃더니, <<his>> 손가락에서 초콜릿을 핥아먹고 당신의 이마에 키스한다.
<br><br>

"단 거 고맙다." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. 바구니를 집어 든 <<he>>【은는】 근처 수납장에 넣고는 가버린다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Eden Cabin]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Eden Sweets Lick
<<effects>>

You slowly close your lips around <<his>> finger. With slow strokes of your tongue, you lick and suck the chocolate away while Eden watches you with hungry, unwavering attention.
<br><br>

"<<goodGirl>>," <<he>> says, sliding <<his>> finger down your tongue and popping it out of your mouth. <<He>> reaches into the box.
<br><br>

"Since you did so well with that," <<he>> says, selecting another piece and trapping it lightly between <<his>> teeth before tugging you closer.
<br><br>

<<link [[에덴에게 키스한다|Eden Sweets Sex]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[몸을 뺀다|Eden Sweets Pull Away]]>><</link>>

:: Eden Sweets Pull Away
<<effects>>

에덴에게서 몸을 뺀다. <<He>>【은는】 당신을 보며 픽 웃고는, 초콜릿을 마저 먹은 뒤 당신의 이마에 키스한다.
<br><br>

"단 거 고맙다." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. 바구니를 집어 든 <<he>>【은는】 근처 수납장에 넣고는 가버린다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Eden Cabin]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Eden Sweets Sex
<<if $sexstart is 1>>
	<<set $sexstart to 0>>
	<<consensual>>
	<<set $consensual to 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>

	<<maninit>>
